---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-surface-100/60">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-4">
        <span class="w-8 h-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 via-maroon-500 to-brown-500"></span>
        About Me
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">

        <!-- TODO: Tone Customization - You can edit this paragraph to sound more personal or formal -->
        <p>
          I am a Computer Science graduate of COMSATS University Islamabad, focused on building AI-powered applications backed by cloud-native, containerized services.
        </p>

        <!-- TODO: Tone Customization - Adjust how you want to present your AI/ML and DevOps expertise -->
        <p>
          I've built and fine-tuned machine learning models for speech and image tasks, including transfer learning pipelines and LLM-based feedback systems deployed with ONNX-optimized inference.
        </p>

        <!-- TODO: Tone Customization - Closing statement and outlook -->
        <p>
          I approach every project with a problem-solving mindset and a commitment to continuous learning, and I'm always eager to take on new challenges and contribute to impactful technologies.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
